0,north,"I will start by exploring my surroundings to get a better understanding of the level layout. Since I am currently in a room, I will try to move out of it by going in a direction where there is no wall. I will prioritize moving north, east, south, or west over diagonals to minimize the chance of bumping into a wall. Once I'm out of the room, I will continue to explore and search for hidden doors, passages, and stairs down. If I encounter any enemies, I will use my quarterstaff or other available items to defend myself. I will also keep an eye on my inventory and use items that can aid in exploration, such as the wand of undead turning or the scroll of light. My ultimate goal is to find the stairs down to progress to the next level.","message:


